[{"client_msg_id":"bf4dbf53-2417-496e-8d6c-03474531ac77","type":"message","user":"UBNPMJJGM","text":"自分はこんな小細工をしてターミナルバッファだけ `ambiwidth=single` になるようにしてます。一応うまく動いていますが、小手先の対応ですし `BufEnter` のたびに関数が呼ばれるのでお勧めはしづらいですね:sweat_smile:\n\n```vim9script\n\ns:set_ambiwidth()\naugroup my_vimrc\n  autocmd BufEnter,TerminalWinOpen * s:set_ambiwidth()\naugroup END\n\ndef s:set_ambiwidth(): void\n  if \u0026amp;buftype ==# \"terminal\"\n    set ambiwidth=single\n  else\n    set ambiwidth=double\n  endif\nenddef```","ts":"1627044108.259800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zHQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7a0cba50-40b1-4285-9ef2-43fd7b65d7de","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"Windows Terminalはフォントの文字列幅の尊重するのでHackGenで罫線がうまく表示されるとか","ts":"1627036548.256900","edited":{"user":"UKHUVMBJR","ts":"1627036555.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UGYM5NT2T"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1KY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d76eacbc-48d2-46d3-a256-f380ada8a370","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"どのフォントで崩れるかってのもターミナル次第なんですよね","ts":"1627036508.256400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Rl1s"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d2f673a5-a42b-48ff-9040-bd84f13f75ca","type":"message","user":"UGYM5NT2T","text":"今まではターミナルフォントにCicaやRictyを使っていたのですが、HackGenに変えてから全角記号の表示が壊れちゃいました。","ts":"1627036461.256100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dqxWy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e87c0336-08cd-4054-adac-60d3de092318","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"自分も、doubleにしないと困る場面にまだ出くわしていない","ts":"1627036367.254600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Mc+Gz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7f597791-a98c-400c-b910-374ac21f7b82","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"個人的には、ターミナルの ambiguous width は single に統一してしまって良いのではという気がしますね。\n一部の記号などは狭く表示されますが、私の場合それで実用的に困ることがほぼないので。double に設定してたときよりはトラブルの数がかなり減りました。\nもちろん用途にもよるのでしょうけど。","ts":"1627035856.253800","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1627035879.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UGYM5NT2T"]},{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gSu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3965907d-2b8b-42cc-a763-4bacbbbbbb2a","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"E149: 残念ですが setcellwidths にはヘルプがありません","ts":"1627035833.253300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xPphT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"DC0646C4-ED9B-402C-957C-E3E55A7460A6","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ツライ","ts":"1627035828.253000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ih8R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"27a8d194-1e83-4b60-a980-5ecd471add65","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"なかった…","ts":"1627035806.251900","thread_ts":"1627035782.251300","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fED"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"52670987-fbee-4010-9667-a6c4cd7b5e32","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"setcellwidthsってNeovimにあるんでしたっけ","ts":"1627035782.251300","thread_ts":"1627035782.251300","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j/lNi"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"11288C9A-679D-4B1A-99E0-32DDEAB02DD4","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"そんなオプションあったのか","ts":"1627035784.251500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yxb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"52670987-fbee-4010-9667-a6c4cd7b5e32","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"setcellwidthsってNeovimにあるんでしたっけ","ts":"1627035782.251300","thread_ts":"1627035782.251300","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j/lNi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5572535c-10a3-46d2-8e9d-f44e9907fcb4","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"--no-unicode オプションでひとまずは回避できそう？","ts":"1627035689.250600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ipKxn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"38304290-4f49-4242-baf2-93ece99b0290","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"fzf ならこのあたりが関係してますかね\n\u003chttps://github.com/junegunn/fzf/issues/1533\u003e","ts":"1627035663.250200","attachments":[{"color":"cb2431","fallback":"649x627px image","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/junegunn/fzf/issues/1533|#1533 Formatting corrupted when Unicode East Asian Ambiguous characters are wide\u003e","text":"• Category\n    ☑︎ fzf binary\n    ☐ fzf-tmux script\n    ☐ Key bindings\n    ☐ Completion\n    ☐ Vim\n    ☐ Neovim\n    ☐ Etc.\n• OS\n    ☐ Linux\n    ☑︎ Mac OS X\n    ☐ Windows\n    ☐ Windows Subsystem for Linux\n    ☐ Etc.\n• Shell\n    • [s] bash\n    ☐ zsh\n    ☐ fish\n\n* * *\n\nUnder macOS built-in Apple Terminal, if you have the setting \"Unicode East Asian Ambiguous characters are wide\" checked, and are using the `--preview` option, the formatting is corrupted. You get something like this:  \n\u003chttps://user-images.githubusercontent.com/2793313/54850441-6edf8280-4ca4-11e9-909f-f6a3bec0ec75.png|fzf\u003e\n\nOf course, the workaround is to uncheck the option, but that option is needed in many situations. East Asian users need it for their text. See \u003chttp://www.unicode.org/reports/tr11/|Unicode® Standard Annex #11: East Asian Width\u003e.\n\nIn particular, if the command prompt or command line has an ambiguous width character and that option is not set, then searching and editing command lines can fail because the cursor is not properly placed.\n\nSee \u003chttps://github.com/bpython/bpython/issues/254|bpython/bpython#254\u003e for how a similar issue was resolved in another project. This utility might be a help: \u003chttps://github.com/mattn/go-runewidth/blob/master/runewidth_posix.go|https://github.com/mattn/go-runewidth/blob/master/runewidth_posix.go\u003e","image_url":"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/2793313/54850441-6edf8280-4ca4-11e9-909f-f6a3bec0ec75.png","fields":[{"title":"Assignees","value":"junegunn","short":true},{"title":"Comments","value":"2","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/junegunn/fzf|junegunn/fzf\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1553286714}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"z9J4a"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ccd411a4-f4df-4198-8edd-082df51d21cc","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"これって使えましたっけ?","ts":"1627035653.249900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fI7ea"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\nsetcellwidths({list})                                   *setcellwidths()*\n                指定した文字のレンジのセル幅を上書きする。これは、文字の幅が画\n                面のセルで数えてどれだけになるかを Vim に教えるのに使う。\n                これは 'ambiwidth' を上書きする。例:  \n                   setcellwidths([[0xad, 0xad, 1],\n                                \\ [0x2194, 0x2199, 2]])\n```","ts":"1627035644.249600","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"91b617ee-ec10-4a97-82d4-bc8e3d55285c","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":":help setcellwidths(","ts":"1627035643.249500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9Is"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5d3e75aa-5429-4686-b020-987eba87db4c","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"とうとう表示できなくなったw","ts":"1627035616.249300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YsM8H"}]},{"type":"message","user":"USLACKBOT","text":"\u003chttps://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F014X5AEVK6/____________________________2020-06-03_13.41.59.png\u003e","ts":"1627035604.248800","files":[{"id":"F014X5AEVK6","created":0,"timestamp":0,"name":"","title":"","mimetype":"","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"","pretty_type":"","user":"","mode":"hidden_by_limit","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":0,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"","url_private_download":"","original_h":0,"original_w":0,"thumb_64":"","thumb_80":"","thumb_160":"","thumb_360":"","thumb_360_gif":"","thumb_360_w":0,"thumb_360_h":0,"thumb_480":"","thumb_480_w":0,"thumb_480_h":0,"thumb_720":"","thumb_720_w":0,"thumb_720_h":0,"thumb_960":"","thumb_960_w":0,"thumb_960_h":0,"thumb_1024":"","thumb_1024_w":0,"thumb_1024_h":0,"permalink":"","permalink_public":"","edit_link":"","preview":"","preview_highlight":"","lines":0,"lines_more":0,"is_public":false,"public_url_shared":false,"channels":null,"groups":null,"ims":null,"initial_comment":{},"comments_count":0,"num_stars":0,"is_starred":false,"shares":{"public":null,"private":null},"display_as_bot":false,"has_rich_preview":false,"username":""}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"92f09fb1-2e86-4673-b0db-40437df07998","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"!ambiwidth","ts":"1627035603.248700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6G4B"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4b45f20d-64ba-40f3-b094-c64ae58be0e0","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"しょうがない(つらい)","ts":"1627035599.248500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cZIZv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ae06fd12-e198-4fba-b6fe-c5a02db8f0f8","type":"message","user":"UGYM5NT2T","text":"`vimrc` の `set ambiwidth=double` とiTerm2の `Ambiguous characters are double-width`  を消すと治りました！\nでも、これだと全角記号の表示がおかしくなってしまうのですが、しょうがないことなのでしょうか…？","ts":"1627035486.248200","edited":{"user":"UGYM5NT2T","ts":"1627036354.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dLD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"932C9D84-B84D-4D43-BC73-0E09DB2D41B5","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"doubleになってると、崩れそうな雰囲気","ts":"1627035306.246000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"13g"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n                                                *'ambiwidth'* *'ambw'*\n'ambiwidth' 'ambw'      文字列  (既定では \"single\")\n                        グローバル\n        'encoding' が \"utf-8\" などUnicodeエンコーディングのときのみ効果がある。\n        East Asian Width Class Ambiguous な文字(ユーロ、登録商標記号、著作権記\n        号、ギリシャ文字、キリル文字など)をどう扱うかを定める。\n \n        現在のところ、設定可能な値は次の2通りである:\n        \"single\":       US-ASCIIの文字と同じ幅を使う。これはほとんどのユーザー\n                        にとって期待どおりになる。\n        \"double\":       ASCII文字の2倍の幅を使う。\n```","ts":"1627035277.245200","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"FB014248-F106-4F0C-B019-8CC05576A7EF","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":":h ambiwidth","ts":"1627035276.245100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ewWt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2BED1CDA-807A-4103-AA85-9ABCBC709DB9","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"それっぽそう","ts":"1627035249.244700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AE9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2657a17d-d05b-4aa9-bd4c-67094ba25758","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"うーんambiwidth?","ts":"1627035